    "1 1/2 teaspoon erythritol"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all of the ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-yogurt-granola-bowl/#wprm-recipe-54359-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Keto-Yogurt-Granola-Bowl-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "On a cutting board, chop up the pecans and almonds.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-yogurt-granola-bowl/#wprm-recipe-54359-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Keto-Yogurt-Granola-Bowl-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a bowl, combine the chopped pecans and almonds with the chia seeds. Mix together.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-yogurt-granola-bowl/#wprm-recipe-54359-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Keto-Yogurt-Granola-Bowl-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a frying pan over medium heat, add in the coconut oil and erythritol.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-yogurt-granola-bowl/#wprm-recipe-54359-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Keto-Yogurt-Granola-Bowl-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Toss in the nuts + seeds to the frying pan. Toast for about 5 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-yogurt-granola-bowl/#wprm-recipe-54359-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Keto-Yogurt-Granola-Bowl-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a serving glass, pour the greek yogurt, then the nuts + seeds, then the raspberries. Create another layer by repeating the previous steps.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-yogurt-granola-bowl/#wprm-recipe-54359-step-0-5",
